    | اشتقاق_جسون_نوع_حقل_غير_مدعوم
    // A -l library of `run`/`interpret` found only as a static archive.
    | مكتبة_تفسير_ساكنة_فقط
    // A -l library of `run`/`interpret` whose macOS `.tbd` stub names no install name.
    | مكتبة_تفسير_بلا_اسم_تثبيت
    // Retired: no longer emitted. Supax reports manifest and dependency
    // errors (SULTANC-PACKAGE-GIT-DEPENDENCY-UNRESOLVED,
    // SULTANC-PACKAGE-DEPENDENCY-MAP-INVALID; see بيان_حزمة_غير_صالح).
    | اعتمادية_جت_غير_محلولة
    | خريطة_اعتماديات_غير_صالحة
    // A -l library of `run`/`interpret` the host's dynamic loader could not load.
    | مكتبة_تفسير_غير_محملة
    // The system C compiler (SULTANC_C_COMPILER=cc) asked for a target other than the host.
    | مترجم_سي_لغير_المضيف
    // The system C compiler failed on an imported C translation unit.
    | فشل_مترجم_سي
    // The C library a C import's target names was found in no library directory (a warning).
    | مكتبة_سي_غير_موجودة
    // An environment variable the compiler reads holds a value it does not accept.
    | قيمة_متغير_بيئة_غير_مقبولة
    // An opaque type used by value: a local, field, payload, parameter, result, reference or element.
    | نوع_معتم_بالقيمة
    // An opaque type as a type argument, written (`f<T>`, `G<T>`) or inferred.
    | نوع_معتم_حجة_نوع
    // `*p` where p points at an opaque type, inside unsafe too.
    | فك_مؤشر_معتم
    // A field access on an opaque type, through a pointer or not.
    | حقل_عبر_مؤشر_معتم
    // `p[i]` where p points at an opaque type: it has no element size.
    | حساب_مؤشر_معتم
    // A --package-graph file that cannot be used (driver/package_graph.sn),
    // reported at its place in that file.
    | رسم_حزم_غير_صالح
    // No standard library where the compiler looks (driver/std_location.sn).
    | مكتبة_قياسية_غير_موجودة
    // A source file `sultanc fmt --check` would change.
    | ملف_غير_منسق
    // Module spellings (frontend/module_loading/module_spellings.sn): a
    // `module` declaration naming no child of its folder, a spelling two
    // children share, a reserved word as a spelling, and `module` outside a
    // folder's root file.
    | وحدة_معلنة_بلا_ابن
    | تهجئة_وحدة_مشتركة
    | تهجئة_وحدة_محجوزة
    | تصريح_وحدة_خارج_ملف_الجذر
;

// Diagnostic classification is stable metadata, independent of presentation.
عام نوع فئة_تشخيص =
    | مستخدم
    | بيئة
    | داخلي
    // A compiler limitation that is neither the user's mistake nor an internal
    // failure (GCC's "sorry, unimplemented"). Shown in full, like a user error.
    | غير_منفذ
;

